Spring Boot @ManyToMany using JPA Repository- Practice Tasks
Task 1: Music Festival Artist Management System
Objective
Develop a Spring Boot application to manage Artists and Music Festivals using a Many-to-Many
relationship.
Relationship- One Artist can perform at multiple Festivals.- One Festival can have multiple Artists.
Relationship Type: @ManyToMany
Entity 1: Artist
Variables:- artistId- artistName- genre- country- experienceYears
Entity 2: Festival
Variables:- festivalId- festivalName- city- eventDate- ticketPrice
Repository Tasks
1. Save a new Artist with multiple Festivals.
2. Save a new Festival with multiple Artists.
3. Find Artist by artistName.
4. Find Festival by festivalName.
5. Find all Artists performing in a particular Festival.
6. Find all Festivals attended by a particular Artist.
7. Update Festival ticketPrice.
8. Update Artist experienceYears.
9. Delete an Artist.
10. Delete a Festival.
11. Display all Artists.
12. Display all Festivals.
Expected Join Table
artist_festival
artist_id
festival_id